# Keep the build context small and the image free of local state.
.git
node_modules
apple
windows
pi
site
marketing
docs
data
media
# Built pack media is hundreds of MB and is downloaded on demand instead — but
# index.json is the download CATALOG the picker reads, so it has to survive.
# An excluded directory can't be COPY'd out of, hence the negation.
packs/*
!packs/index.json
build
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.DS_Store
